  {
   "heading": "Demands for administrative reorganization",
   "text": "In August 2024, Chief Minister N. Biren Singh announced a statewide district boundary reorganization survey aimed at reorganizing district borders based on administrative convenience. However, any formal notifications or boundary changes are pending the completion of the 2027 census of India, which has frozen existing administrative boundaries until 31 March 2027.",
